      "schemeImageUrl": "",
      "detailedDescription_md": "Indira Gandhi National Vridhavastha Pension Yojana, Under the Department of Social Justice and Empowerment  Government of Rajasthan, provides financial support to the citizens whose families live below the poverty line. To empower senior citizens by ensuring their financial independence and dignity in old age, thereby enabling them to lead a dignified life.\n",
